# CodeAlpha Image Gallery

A responsive image gallery built as part of my CodeAlpha Frontend Development internship.

## Features
- Responsive grid layout (works on mobile, tablet and desktop)
- Category filters (All, Nature, City, Animals)
- Lightbox view with next, previous and close buttons
- Keyboard support (arrow keys and Esc)
- Hover effects and smooth transitions

## Technologies
HTML, CSS, JavaScript

## How to run
Download the project and open `index.html` in your browser.

